# Next lap (staged): Devstral Small 1.1 (2507) AWQ - text-only MistralForCausalLM (avoids the Pixtral import path), agent-tuned, 131K.
[Service]
Environment=OMEN_MODEL=/home/derek/models/devstral-small-2507-awq-int4
